1
00:00:39,280 --> 00:00:40,030
No.

2
00:02:15,100 --> 00:02:16,550
[Dearest Episode 6]

3
00:02:19,840 --> 00:02:21,170
Miss Wen, you're awake.

4
00:02:21,579 --> 00:02:24,060
Why are you planning to leave
without a word?

5
00:02:25,090 --> 00:02:26,740
I was afraid of waking you up.

6
00:02:26,770 --> 00:02:28,560
Thank you for the clothes, Dr. Jiang.

7
00:02:28,560 --> 00:02:30,220
I'll return them another day.

8
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:32,850
And thank you for saving me yesterday.

9
00:02:32,900 --> 00:02:34,250
I'll contact Shang Yu

10
00:02:34,310 --> 00:02:36,850
and let him send you
a gift to show my gratitude.

11
00:02:36,850 --> 00:02:38,020
Is that all?

12
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:42,820
I remember yesterday that

13
00:02:43,180 --> 00:02:45,210
you hugged and kissed me,

14
00:02:45,630 --> 00:02:48,630
and said you wanted me to stay
by your side forever.

15
00:02:49,190 --> 00:02:50,520
Now that the drug has worn off,

16
00:02:50,520 --> 00:02:52,780
you're acting like a different one, huh?

17
00:03:06,120 --> 00:03:07,590
Didn't you say, Dr. Jiang,

18
00:03:08,210 --> 00:03:09,640
that after I sobered up,

19
00:03:10,540 --> 00:03:12,230
I could do whatever I wanted?

20
00:03:20,630 --> 00:03:21,520
Dr. Jiang,

21
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,490
you didn't take it seriously, did you?

22
00:03:30,680 --> 00:03:31,590
Dr. Jiang,

23
00:03:32,840 --> 00:03:34,280
no drug

24
00:03:34,710 --> 00:03:35,870
requires

25
00:03:36,050 --> 00:03:38,450
sex as an antidote.

26
00:03:38,870 --> 00:03:39,840
If there is,

27
00:03:40,600 --> 00:03:42,320
it must be that the woman

28
00:03:43,190 --> 00:03:45,060
really wants to cling to you.

29
00:03:46,440 --> 00:03:47,630
Am I right,

30
00:03:48,630 --> 00:03:49,670
Alex?

31
00:03:52,630 --> 00:03:53,760
You knew the truth?

32
00:03:55,650 --> 00:03:56,970
I was wondering

33
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:00,190
why you understand women so well.

34
00:04:00,190 --> 00:04:02,190
It turns out you're a professional.

35
00:04:03,510 --> 00:04:06,040
No wonder Wen Xin thought
you looked familiar

36
00:04:06,340 --> 00:04:08,170
the first time she saw you.

37
00:04:18,829 --> 00:04:20,750
There’s absolutely no way you could
afford to live in the Clousea penthouse

38
00:04:20,750 --> 00:04:23,610
by working as
a rehabilitation massage therapist.

39
00:04:24,080 --> 00:04:26,340
You faked paralysis in the nursing home,

40
00:04:27,310 --> 00:04:29,270
faked weakness in the Wen family,

41
00:04:33,159 --> 00:04:36,070
and put on a pitiful act now.

42
00:04:37,870 --> 00:04:40,870
You've been nominated
for Best Actress so many times.

43
00:04:41,390 --> 00:04:42,850
How come you didn't win it?

44
00:04:44,750 --> 00:04:47,040
Yes, I was acting.

45
00:04:47,490 --> 00:04:51,050
We actors can do anything for a role.

46
00:04:51,980 --> 00:04:53,690
What happened last night

47
00:04:54,420 --> 00:04:56,540
was just a sacrifice for art.

48
00:04:58,640 --> 00:05:00,900
Didn't you take it seriously, Dr. Jiang?

49
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,490
Your acting

50
00:05:06,840 --> 00:05:08,230
is terrible.

51
00:05:09,430 --> 00:05:11,030
I wasn't drawn into it at all.

52
00:05:11,510 --> 00:05:13,040
Miss Wen,

53
00:05:13,310 --> 00:05:15,510
you should improve your acting skills.

54
00:05:18,630 --> 00:05:19,510
Dr. Jiang,

55
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:22,400
your acting isn't much better.

56
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,510
What kind of doctor would

57
00:05:25,040 --> 00:05:27,300
wear perfume and style his hair like you?

58
00:05:30,160 --> 00:05:32,159
Then, why are you keeping me around?

59
00:05:35,800 --> 00:05:38,070
Don't you want to go back to Dad too,

60
00:05:39,510 --> 00:05:40,360
my

61
00:05:42,840 --> 00:05:43,990
dear brother?

62
00:05:52,070 --> 00:05:52,680
What?

63
00:05:53,810 --> 00:05:54,690
Are you scared?

64
00:05:56,150 --> 00:05:58,390
Do you really think you're my brother?

65
00:05:59,260 --> 00:06:00,660
Do you think I'm an idiot?

66
00:06:15,960 --> 00:06:17,860
What exactly happened that night?

67
00:06:17,860 --> 00:06:19,220
How did my mother die?

68
00:06:24,120 --> 00:06:26,650
In the basement of
the Wen family's old house,

69
00:06:27,270 --> 00:06:28,420
He Mu

70
00:06:29,310 --> 00:06:30,770
picked up a Buddha statue.

71
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:35,360
Are you saying

72
00:06:37,700 --> 00:06:39,700
my mother was killed by He Mu?

73
00:06:40,320 --> 00:06:41,000
Yes.

74
00:06:41,980 --> 00:06:43,370
I saw it with my own eyes.

75
00:06:44,600 --> 00:06:46,260
You knew about this all along.

76
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,800
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

77
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:50,730
Aren't you doing this for revenge?

78
00:06:51,240 --> 00:06:52,720
If I had told you then,

79
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,240
would you have believed me?

80
00:06:54,240 --> 00:06:55,640
Or would you have thought

81
00:06:56,510 --> 00:06:57,840
I was making up stories,

82
00:06:58,140 --> 00:06:59,170
lying to you,

83
00:06:59,250 --> 00:07:00,980
and shirking responsibility?

84
00:07:07,270 --> 00:07:08,830
I kept you by my side

85
00:07:09,250 --> 00:07:10,690
to let you see the truth

86
00:07:10,710 --> 00:07:12,570
and gave you a chance for revenge.

87
00:07:12,570 --> 00:07:15,240
Jiang Yu, you should thank me.

88
00:07:18,680 --> 00:07:19,560
Wen Jianan,

89
00:07:21,120 --> 00:07:22,850
you are taking advantage of me.

90
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:24,360
Jiang Yu,

91
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:27,120
aren't you doing the same?

92
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:28,200
Boss.

93
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:29,750
I found out. He...

94
00:07:32,430 --> 00:07:33,810
He Mu got close to Councilman Qin

95
00:07:33,810 --> 00:07:35,690
for the Xingji land deal.

96
00:07:38,210 --> 00:07:38,940
Got it.

97
00:07:44,140 --> 00:07:45,500
If he gets it,

98
00:07:46,190 --> 00:07:48,390
he'll be the hero of
the Wen family's expansion.

99
00:07:48,390 --> 00:07:49,830
But if he succeeds…

100
00:07:49,830 --> 00:07:51,560
Then, we won't let him succeed.

101
00:07:53,000 --> 00:07:53,870
He previously

102
00:07:55,390 --> 00:07:57,720
misled me into thinking we were siblings,

103
00:07:59,000 --> 00:08:02,000
using my hatred to take revenge on you.

104
00:08:03,240 --> 00:08:04,300
Little did he know,

105
00:08:04,510 --> 00:08:08,600
a pawn can also become a player.

106
00:08:11,270 --> 00:08:12,950
I want him to be humiliated

107
00:08:14,050 --> 00:08:15,850
and consumed by his own desires.

108
00:08:17,070 --> 00:08:17,830
Then,

109
00:08:19,720 --> 00:08:21,190
our cooperation begins.

110
00:08:27,870 --> 00:08:30,000
It's a pleasure cooperating with you,

111
00:08:30,070 --> 00:08:31,040
Miss Wen.

112
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:46,440
It was you

113
00:08:47,270 --> 00:08:48,600
who framed my father.
